    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="baba4bcb-899a-57a9-bc27-90d0f5ff6a95" activityNameId="aafd714f-146c-5f87-bd90-3c5cb0057021" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Photovoltaic cell, pc-Si , at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Photovoltaic cell, pc-Si , at plant
Production of photovoltaic cells (100cm2) with an efficiency of 13.5% and 1.3Wp.;
UUID: e4f2e138-5b05-3a38-8175-ec5c93052449
Cleaning, damage etching, texture etching, covering of backside, phosphor dotation, phosphor glass etching, printing of contacts, cleaning and quality testing.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production of photovoltaic cells from wafers.
Time period: Most of the data published in 1992, some newer information.
Production volume: Total worldwide production 243MW in 2000. Europe 37MW.
Sampling: Publication of plant specific (partly aggregated) data.  
Extrapolations: N2 use estimated with data for mc-Si cell.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e4f2e138-5b05-3a38-8175-ec5c93052449.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
